<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Document> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Document> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Document" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/DocumentPart> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "a distinct part of a larger document or collected document." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/DocumentPart> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
