<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/DocumentStatus> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The status of the publication of a document." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/DocumentStatus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/DocumentStatus> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Document Status" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/EditedBook> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An edited book." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/EditedBook> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
