<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/PersonalCommunicationDocument> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A personal communication manifested in some document." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/PersonalCommunicationDocument> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/PersonalCommunicationDocument> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Personal Communication Document" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Proceedings> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A compilation of documents published from an event, such as a conference." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Proceedings> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Proceedings> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Proceedings" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Quote> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "An excerpted collection of words." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Quote> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
