<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/ReferenceSource> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A document that presents authoritative reference information, such as a dictionary or encylopedia ." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/ReferenceSource> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/ReferenceSource> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Reference Source" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Report> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A document describing an account or statement describing in detail an event, situation, or the like, usually as the result of observation, inquiry, etc.." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Report> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Report> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Report" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Series> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A loose, thematic, collection of Documents, often Books." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Series> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Series> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Series" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Slide> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A slide in a slideshow" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Slide> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
