<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Slideshow> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A presentation of a series of slides, usually presented in front of an audience with written text and images." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Slideshow> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Slideshow> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Slideshow" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Specification> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A document describing a specification." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Specification> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
