<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Standard> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A document describing a standard: a specification organized through a standards body." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Standard> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
