<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Thesis> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A document created to summarize research findings associated with the completion of an academic degree." .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Thesis> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
