<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/ThesisDegree> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The academic degree of a Thesis" .
<http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/ThesisDegree> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZBibliographicType> .
