<http://purl.org/spar/cito/citesAsRelated> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:r8912aefacb6a1643f81d0ee9_n9982c2e81549441598c20f0d686608edb2 .
<http://purl.org/spar/cito/credits> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The citing entity acknowledges contributions made by the cited entity." .
<http://purl.org/spar/cito/credits> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Property> .
