<http://purl.org/spar/cito/isDescribedBy> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The cited entity is described by the citing entity." .
<http://purl.org/spar/cito/isDescribedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Property> .
<http://purl.org/spar/cito/isDescribedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "is described by" .
