<http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#isFsfLibre> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Specifies whether the Free Software Foundation (FSF) has listed a License as \"free\" in their commentary on licenses, located at the time of this writing at Various Licenses and Comments about Them. A value of \"true\" indicates that the license is in the list of licenses that FSF publishes as libre. A value of \"false\" indicates that the license is explicitly not in the corresponding list of FSF libre licenses (e.g., FSF has the license on a non-free list)." .
<http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#isFsfLibre> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Property> .
<http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#isFsfLibre> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "FSF libre" .
