<http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#isFsfLibre> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:rf8e0c5dee082757834c35288_n5a27dcb7087a4673a206918c26ca3627b2 .
<http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#isOsiApproved> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Specifies whether the Open Source Initiative (OSI) has listed a License as \"approved\" in their list of OSI Approved Licenses, located at the time of this writing at OSI Approved Licenses. A value of \"true\" indicates that the license is in the list of licenses that OSI publishes as approved. A value of \"false\" indicates that the license is explicitly not in the corresponding list of OSI licenses (e.g., OSI has stated publicly that a license is not approved)." .
<http://spdx.org/rdf/terms#isOsiApproved> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Property> .
