<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competition-types/6b12c2e8-b40b-49f1-b847-d7ccfc7442d2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZCompetitionType> .
