<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/36b9dd97-061a-4be5-ad90-3b98d0be2c48> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Helmholtz Imaging invites researchers across the Helmholtz Association to submit proposals for the Helmholtz Imaging Project Call 2026. The call supports collaborative, cross-disciplinary research projects that advance imaging science and strengthen the connection between imaging and information & data science.\n\nResearchers from at least two Helmholtz Centers, with optional participation of external partners, are encouraged to join forces and develop innovative solutions along the imaging pipeline – from data acquisition to knowledge extraction.\n\nProposals can be submitted via the Helmholtz Imaging project portal: https://projects.helmholtz-imaging.de/site/index.php" .
