<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/635627aa-fbe4-4550-a623-41ecdc586156> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> "AvH-Feodor Lynen-Research Fellowship" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/a34e4534-6181-4f78-a2b5-bf210d8ee235> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The goal of this call is to support projects that significantly improve the quality, long-term sustainability, reusability, and visibility of research software within the Helmholtz Association. Projects should implement and promote good practices in software engineering and foster collaboration and knowledge exchange among researchers and software developers." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/a34e4534-6181-4f78-a2b5-bf210d8ee235> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/subject> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/topics/research-software-engineering> .
