<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/c2a58f79-34f6-49bd-a813-6ac41faf34d9> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/influenced_by> _:r7585320b605d1f2070f4329c_n3c0a1f39e6584d3f8519ca2efd895d20b5 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/c2a58f79-34f6-49bd-a813-6ac41faf34d9> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> "Powerful tools for research data management, in particular for sensitive data" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/d254c531-0a3d-4d18-91b8-ddbc3ed6abb8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The NSTC (Taiwan) Research Fellowship supports researchers from Germany in conducting a research stay in Taiwan, regardless of discipline. The Alexander von Humboldt Foundation conducts the preselection in Germany, while NSTC (Taiwan) funds the recipient’s stay at a university or non-university research institute in Taiwan. Any researcher or scholar in Taiwan who has received project funding through the National Science and Technology Council (NSTC) is eligible to serve as a host.\n\nPostdocs and experienced researchers up to 12 years after completing their doctorate may apply for a 3- to 12-month fellowship. Applications are accepted online throughout the year, and to ensure timely processing, all required documents should be submitted 4 to 7 months before the intended selection date. The Selection Committee responsible for reviewing applications meets every February, June, and October." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/d254c531-0a3d-4d18-91b8-ddbc3ed6abb8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZCompetition> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/d254c531-0a3d-4d18-91b8-ddbc3ed6abb8> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:rc6dee74712f15c332fbeb0be_n85ddefa6bcf543b199a515b5a6a341bfb1 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/d254c531-0a3d-4d18-91b8-ddbc3ed6abb8> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:rc6dee74712f15c332fbeb0be_n85ddefa6bcf543b199a515b5a6a341bfb2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/d254c531-0a3d-4d18-91b8-ddbc3ed6abb8> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rc6dee74712f15c332fbeb0be_n85ddefa6bcf543b199a515b5a6a341bfb3 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/d254c531-0a3d-4d18-91b8-ddbc3ed6abb8> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> "AvH - NSTC (Taiwan) Research Fellowships" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/dec37bc9-8d86-48f8-9a6c-1d401e0c7057> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "It is possible to apply for funding of up to € 115,000 for a period of up to 24 months. Funding can be used for all types of costs, but no more than € 67,000 gross for the fellow’s salary for the duration of the project. Junior group leaders or junior professors cannot apply for funding for their own position. Projects can start between May 1 and Oct. 1, 2027.\n\n\n\nThe program addresses postdoctoral researchers who 1) are employed at a state-funded (public law) university or state-funded (public law) university of applied sciences (= öffentlich-rechtliche Universität oder HAW), at a Bundesamt or Bundesanstalt (Ressortforschung), at a Fraunhofer, Leibniz, Max Planck, Helmholtz, or DLR institute or at EMBL in Germany at the latest at the start of your project, 2) conduct non-clinical research in one or more of the following areas: Biology, Chemistry, Computer Science, Geosciences, Mathematics, Neurosciences and Physics, 3) do not yet have a permanent position or tenure option, and 4) do not have acquired further substantial funding." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competitions/dec37bc9-8d86-48f8-9a6c-1d401e0c7057> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/competition-types/4e49ac7d-d6da-4131-806b-6425491e26fd> .
