<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/grants/a8b5c3b6-e00f-484f-b494-afa09df6557b> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> "From recognition to regulation: Combining meta-analytic priors with machine learning for decoding affective brain–behavior relationships in health and disease" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/grants/a9fab6a8-7854-41e8-869f-0cec467875c2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The project aims (1) to investigate the extent to which geometric attributes of brain structures capture individual-level information and (2) to enhance the interpretability of mathematical descriptors, particularly the Laplace-Beltrami operator (LBO) spectrum or LB Shape Descriptor (LBSD), in order to gain novel insights into the brain's geometry and its relation to individual characteristics." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/grants/a9fab6a8-7854-41e8-869f-0cec467875c2> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> _:rcd82ec17212406d608b2c815_ncf2b22d2c3b84ba899231d1034d95ea4b1 .
