<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/grants/bfdf216c-c749-46da-a59e-4da2abad45fc> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> "Linking brain functional trajectories in neurodevelopmental disorders to underlying neurotransmitter systems " .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/grants/c083c8d1-fc5f-4352-b8f2-de391a8c8498> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "As part of its Programme-oriented Funding (PoF), the Helmholtz Association does not invest its resources in individual institutions, but rather in cross-centre research programmes that address the major societal challenges of our time. These programmes and their scientific questions are divided into thematical units (\"Topics\"). The fourth period of programme-oriented funding (PoF IV) is running from 2021-2027." .
