<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/case-e> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "case-e is a self-contained Electronic Case Report Form (eCRF) application packaged to run locally. It bundles a FastAPI backend, a Vue.js frontend, an embedded database, and a web server so researchers or clinicians can design study forms, collect subject data, review entries, and export results without installing or configuring external services.\n\nDownloads for macOS and Windows are provided. It’s MIT-licensed and intended as an easy-to-deploy tool for managing clinical/experimental study data." .
