<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/datalad-next> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "datalad-next is a DataLad extension that can be thought of as a staging area for additional functionality, or for improved performance and user experience. Unlike other topical or more experimental extensions, the focus here is on functionality with broad applicability. This extension is a suitable dependency for other software packages that intend to build on this improved set of functionality." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/datalad-next> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/type> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000010> .
