<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/datalad> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/name> "DataLad" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/datasalad> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "datasalad is a pure-Python library with a collection of utilities for working with data in the vicinity of Git and git-annex. While this is a foundational library from and for the DataLad project, its implementations are standalone, and are meant to be equally well usable outside the DataLad system.\n\nA focus of this library is efficient communication with subprocesses, such as Git or git-annex commands, which read and produce data in some format." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/datasalad> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/type> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000010> .
