<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/trr379_pool> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The knowledge pooling tool is a system used for aggregating information on research progress and outputs across TRR379 partner sites and projects. It comprises a web UI for manually submitting, editing, and browsing information, and an API for programmatic submission and retrieval." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/trr379_pool> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> _:r33c66cd90f831484927770e6_nc82306b043164c29bac5e9f8645fdf9db1 .
