<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/trr379_pool> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/influenced_by> _:r33c66cd90f831484927770e6_nc82306b043164c29bac5e9f8645fdf9db6 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/trr379_pool> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/name> "Knowledge Pooling Tool of the TRR379" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/trr379_pool_editor> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "For TRR379 members, the knowledge pool takes the form of a web-based metadata editor. It is used to collect information on research progress and outputs. " .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/trr379_pool_editor> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> _:r5d69466ac8e04166f074c884_n2c53cb3c1cae4ee18db934cc801ff599b1 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/trr379_pool_editor> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/type> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000010> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/trr379_pool_editor> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZInstrument> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/instruments/trr379_pool_editor> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:r5d69466ac8e04166f074c884_n2c53cb3c1cae4ee18db934cc801ff599b2 .
