<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/objectives/self-hosted-it> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:r75a76f265ade4d81cc188dd6_nd46e6433b4a24e7ca5cb5bd42194c3b8b2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/objectives/self-hosted-it> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> "Self-hosted research IT infrastructure" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/4985786a-5a4b-4b86-8fff-0b7be76a6227> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> _:r72e42ae016dad662e237c5ac_nb4ab699ae3294ea7bf54731235ea1ec9b1 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/4985786a-5a4b-4b86-8fff-0b7be76a6227> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZOrganization> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/4985786a-5a4b-4b86-8fff-0b7be76a6227> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote> "The identifier is a EUID (https://euid.eu) taken from the european business register that can be queried at https://e-justice.europa.eu/topics/registers-business-insolvency-land/business-registers-search-company-eu_en\n\nThis is a self-managed ID that isn't really issued by anyone." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/4985786a-5a4b-4b86-8fff-0b7be76a6227> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:r72e42ae016dad662e237c5ac_nb4ab699ae3294ea7bf54731235ea1ec9b2 .
