<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/4985786a-5a4b-4b86-8fff-0b7be76a6227> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/name> "Altertox" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/91f492bf-c0f7-4666-8eb0-5eb8d63070b8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "KonsortSWD – NFDI4Society is the consortium for the social, behavioral, educational\nand economic sciences within the National Research Data Infrastructure (NFDI). Its goal is\nto support researchers in research data management (RDM) and to establish RDM as an\nintegral part of scientific practice." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/organizations/91f492bf-c0f7-4666-8eb0-5eb8d63070b8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZOrganization> .
