<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/20cb1e21-9518-4d22-bfe3-fe87a1587736> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The NAViStem3D project examines the ethical, epistemological, and societal issues surrounding neural organoids—that is, three-dimensional brain models derived from human stem cells. These organoids offer great potential for research into brain development and diseases such as Alzheimer’s and autism, but at the same time raise questions about moral status, data protection, and risks to donors." .
