<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/315bb3fe-bfc9-498b-83d3-f655a1eb2f48> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/started> _:r66780165979b83197c095a87_n088bb3246325479292d93bce9a59fc96b6 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/315bb3fe-bfc9-498b-83d3-f655a1eb2f48> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> "Laplace-Beltrami shape descriptors of brain structures: Comparative optimization and genetic dissection" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/3e30b1db-1b3a-4cd6-b3e1-426fa8912a08> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "With the support of the Federal Ministry of Education and Research (BMBF), the Research Hub Neuroethics (RHUNE) aims to help better connect research in the field of neuroethics in Germany, increase its international visibility and provide a contact point for policymakers, industry and civil society. On behalf of the University of Mannheim, iRights.Lab supports the establishment of a digital information and contact centre and facilitates networking activities to improve the integration of relevant actors." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/3e30b1db-1b3a-4cd6-b3e1-426fa8912a08> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZProject> .
