<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/45e542dd-2d2a-41d0-8399-90f2fde72a21> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> "Multilevel Brain Organization and Variability (PoF-IV)" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/4fd889ce-627f-4d77-99a5-2df75c468d62> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "This project aims to improve our understanding of neurotransmitter system development in the human brain, especially in children and adolescents with attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder (ADHD) and autism spectrum disorder (ASD). By combining non-invasive brain imaging with normative modeling, the project investigates typical and atypical developmental trajectories of neurotransmitter systems, potentially paving the way for new diagnostic and therapeutic strategies in neurodevelopmental disorders." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/4fd889ce-627f-4d77-99a5-2df75c468d62> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZProject> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/4fd889ce-627f-4d77-99a5-2df75c468d62> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/associated_with> _:r13227b172dd740c91739caa0_n52bb0386869f400fa034b44ee63706d6b1 .
