<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/7d475f77-48e7-4d67-b121-274b4582e561> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "As part of its Programme-oriented Funding (PoF), the Helmholtz Association does not invest its resources in individual institutions, but rather in cross-centre research programmes that address the major societal challenges of our time.\n\nThese programmes and their scientific questions are divided into thematical units (\"Topics\"). The fourth period of programme-oriented funding (PoF IV) is running from 2021-2027." .
