<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/9c5e518c-c25c-4bc6-a85f-ade51f8308cd> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "As part of its Programme-oriented Funding (PoF), the Helmholtz Association does not invest its resources in individual institutions, but rather in cross-centre research programmes that address the major societal challenges of our time. These programmes and their scientific questions are divided into thematical units (\"Topics\"). The fifth period of programme-oriented funding (PoF V) is running from 2028-2034." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/9c5e518c-c25c-4bc6-a85f-ade51f8308cd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZProject> .
