<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/c2d2a0d0-a974-46f3-994c-a2699df44b22> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/started> _:ref97bc78f3a9013225b34e8a_n9df8fe34b45e401b9a763859124d61b9b6 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/c2d2a0d0-a974-46f3-994c-a2699df44b22> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> "HELIA: Helfender Roboter im Klinikalltag" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/c600d833-4b34-4f8f-b70c-b4b753fbd475> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The Case-E project aims to develop a flexible, cost-effective open-source solution for Electronic Case Report Forms (eCRFs) that, in particular, facilitates standardised, secure and quality-assured data collection and data exchange in multicentre clinical trials. To this end, JTrack’s expertise in clinical trials and digital data collection (biomarker development) is being combined with DataLad’s expertise in data management (psychoinformatics). Case-E is designed to be easily adaptable to different trials and to be deployed alongside existing clinical IT infrastructures." .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/c600d833-4b34-4f8f-b70c-b4b753fbd475> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZProject> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/projects/c600d833-4b34-4f8f-b70c-b4b753fbd475> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/associated_with> _:r73aab05102cb660fd248ca2a_na572361304264dc69ba3ec6deef44b6cb1 .
