<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/021c7fae-b8cf-462e-a63e-bb12d62d0df5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/021c7fae-b8cf-462e-a63e-bb12d62d0df5> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r36aa20401898667d2b350d9c_na0ca7b6234b9433e8f6c8ead753ecd93b2 .
