<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/066f2457-545b-4720-bd5e-1ad858c1fb12> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:r1c6197a5d9fc66ecb414d9b3_n3448fc55859f41afa4458821d1619d22b5 .
