<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/06839a75-66d7-40ff-91f1-d76b33cca0c2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/06839a75-66d7-40ff-91f1-d76b33cca0c2> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:raa05116a22f29c8abf5b23cb_ne170a8efdeac40d49d7f17fbb0fd4fb7b2 .
