<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/119b0d42-4b5e-498c-b2d4-56ff33f47566> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r7ad9acca3b0ba351e0300978_ndd51f4b1fc9940adae1e0eddef1dec39b2 .
