<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/14e0c5fe-b995-45b5-9e28-e9d4055a804e> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:re2345affbdd6c9122cf48472_nb87d71608079412e9b5bbc2c4396048fb6 .
