<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/15f6113f-8ef6-403c-9618-0b35dc436866> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
