<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/1b5314a3-14a5-464f-aa09-ca7dd64b13af> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
