<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/20bd7330-65f1-4c42-a373-8779cdedd049> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:rb56e7b5003705fe114a42e93_nd067679516884f0ba09256070b8ff46ab4 .
