<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/28525b12-3d0f-4f85-ab47-a2bd1e3bce06> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:r62b4713a264b640212556d58_ndec88948a49045779e1c8ebe56df17f7b5 .
