<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/30825293-f631-45f2-80a0-98ce087b7fbe> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rd262a57d0f1fb4d83ae047f7_ne6241f0b3bf84f9d82c6fbd1e14bed78b4 .
