<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/32f4a4c9-dbf7-4efe-bc94-fac32cb70de6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
