<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/336afbca-c8c4-4150-8a23-84d8e629647a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
