<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/362af628-f218-45bc-8499-9d06d71f0eae> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/362af628-f218-45bc-8499-9d06d71f0eae> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r204dab8c12dc737af36bf846_n7b401728b23d4e6696eb17adf623d9a0b2 .
