<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/362af628-f218-45bc-8499-9d06d71f0eae> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:r204dab8c12dc737af36bf846_n7b401728b23d4e6696eb17adf623d9a0b5 .
