<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/37035b56-c508-426d-9c95-512850687c32> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r2d2f45317a2e4c531a63ceb2_n0e50236fbb33412dbfa02fecae6df6e7b2 .
