<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/37f70d49-c3b3-4835-a954-73229ce4ba08> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:rc7b4d2e80e91fb99204dde32_na093aa44479043318a99623658fec3fcb2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/37f70d49-c3b3-4835-a954-73229ce4ba08> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rc7b4d2e80e91fb99204dde32_na093aa44479043318a99623658fec3fcb3 .
