<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/37fb8be8-a0ad-40aa-b9cd-b6077569186a> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r0bc247e652824b3d7e770064_n834be835054440c284405a1e9409825db2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/37fb8be8-a0ad-40aa-b9cd-b6077569186a> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r0bc247e652824b3d7e770064_n834be835054440c284405a1e9409825db3 .
