<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/4023c141-eb69-44ed-8237-f6b8a26913af> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r2a703cd1cf8540e075cec808_n9369e2bca5174ed0b1dadd0bc82a5abbb4 .
