<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/412cbf0f-250a-45ec-a7f2-86bd6a3fa9e1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/412cbf0f-250a-45ec-a7f2-86bd6a3fa9e1> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:rfb957c750b450e1b20432418_n3e65c85aca5741b595db7c029827b9deb2 .
