<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/45b1ce9d-6d40-49d6-8fc5-32b90a152a9b> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/type> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/AcademicArticle> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/45b1ce9d-6d40-49d6-8fc5-32b90a152a9b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/45b1ce9d-6d40-49d6-8fc5-32b90a152a9b> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r37e6991f2ddc8deb2d3f5d04_n8a4749db851144b881fb0a3942374ba8b2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/45b1ce9d-6d40-49d6-8fc5-32b90a152a9b> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r37e6991f2ddc8deb2d3f5d04_n8a4749db851144b881fb0a3942374ba8b3 .
