<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/49bbc7f1-7fe7-43a9-842f-3c777ca96fcf> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rfccd11249b3bdad8cef179c6_nb5446043c7a44ff8afc128beb1e89d98b4 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/49bbc7f1-7fe7-43a9-842f-3c777ca96fcf> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:rfccd11249b3bdad8cef179c6_nb5446043c7a44ff8afc128beb1e89d98b5 .
