<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/4be278ef-06ae-4686-85db-8060f23e6fee> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Inhibitory control, comprising cognitive inhibition and response inhibition, showed consistent deficits among several major psychiatric disorders. We aim to identify the trans-diagnostic convergence of neuroimaging abnormalities underlying inhibitory control across psychiatric disorders." .
