<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/4f3ef31f-d263-4f1c-b9f2-1d52095055e0> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/type> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/Proceedings> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/4f3ef31f-d263-4f1c-b9f2-1d52095055e0> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/4f3ef31f-d263-4f1c-b9f2-1d52095055e0> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:ra9e0dd76c50d57d44186ae4e_n2b26bb32cde742119d0382491756cb0cb2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/4f3ef31f-d263-4f1c-b9f2-1d52095055e0> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:ra9e0dd76c50d57d44186ae4e_n2b26bb32cde742119d0382491756cb0cb3 .
