<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/5120c5c1-c81d-408b-b7df-34f1854c9f11> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/title> "Brain age Prediction and the Challenge of Biological Concepts of Aging" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/51710284-126c-43e4-8f9a-9ffb1b2c4f84> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Early career researchers (ECRs) are faced with a range of competing pressures in academia, making self-management key to building a successful career. The Organization for Human Brain Mapping undertook a group effort to gather helpful advice for ECRs in self-management" .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/51710284-126c-43e4-8f9a-9ffb1b2c4f84> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> _:r4b376be25f677c72c1d6c69b_n1a8d063879424bbf868438f55343260ab1 .
