<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/51710284-126c-43e4-8f9a-9ffb1b2c4f84> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/51710284-126c-43e4-8f9a-9ffb1b2c4f84> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r4b376be25f677c72c1d6c69b_n1a8d063879424bbf868438f55343260ab2 .
