<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/5c0ec1d7-9669-41d4-a2ae-b749daf79906> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:ree66e0e80b160dcc39371cfa_n888ecdc7ebe94e7da9faf4d755ff9a29b3 .
