<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/5f61d763-0e26-4209-821c-997def722b3f> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r9feca18499d8e919dcd463c7_nb88518919a41453587813ecaceb45a66b2 .
