<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/612deadf-f10f-4d07-a88e-7544453a133d> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:rbb8baabce455ee3b866ff220_nc20e8a2fee214963a634781b1b67bc2cb7 .
