<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/63376f63-e1b3-411a-9400-ab734569d0dc> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/63376f63-e1b3-411a-9400-ab734569d0dc> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r80d232489f3ea3b1babba051_na245d6f7937045cd8674a5b017948c9ab2 .
