<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/651e1ca5-abf6-4231-a8d0-80465ec0bf87> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:r1ca254cdbb2e86bb6e7e822a_n17e532fdf0f9481abcb7ad0f4ef58eb5b9 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/651e1ca5-abf6-4231-a8d0-80465ec0bf87> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/generated_by> _:r1ca254cdbb2e86bb6e7e822a_n17e532fdf0f9481abcb7ad0f4ef58eb5b10 .
