<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/65f493a8-d75a-4529-8c7b-0f692a482be2> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r74c3e72d5e1669bdc3a1c64d_n227c6fa9ac7a4d96a7c71bc3ac2a9d75b7 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/65f493a8-d75a-4529-8c7b-0f692a482be2> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:r74c3e72d5e1669bdc3a1c64d_n227c6fa9ac7a4d96a7c71bc3ac2a9d75b8 .
