<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/670b66b8-46d3-4184-91d6-02620e9ea31a> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r0d7102ea38417669798f1710_nb12defd29c804c52b94f19c68591783bb2 .
