<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/680a41d3-1c10-43ad-be71-80f0ac86b23e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/680a41d3-1c10-43ad-be71-80f0ac86b23e> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r277a234984968988b722261f_n0ffa06def02f486f895822bbc3cb2b11b2 .
