<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/682204e9-50d4-4d16-ac57-d282c7946d86> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
