<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/68cfc7e5-189e-41d7-8cc1-90097002cca7> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:re59e1debb548f71f2a073f41_nf0d25f80336248b4a9c33adaa7726bfeb5 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/68cfc7e5-189e-41d7-8cc1-90097002cca7> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:re59e1debb548f71f2a073f41_nf0d25f80336248b4a9c33adaa7726bfeb6 .
