<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/69639c49-a061-415e-9351-5b113db6f9c1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
