<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/69639c49-a061-415e-9351-5b113db6f9c1> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r829cdddb8f1d3ff8a7f20b49_n2f6d27af8cff4ba893651e8bdf479473b3 .
