<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/6fb2cd42-f5a4-4e43-a758-02d7cef2b80d> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r60995db925f05a697e835fd0_nbf86431f43b7442391d7ea8f96533069b2 .
