<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/74a814b7-71eb-4691-af5d-235e7a75b266> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rebc69e53a0fe4b4c529e0c79_ndacf3541ed5f440aabd46bb442d43858b8 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/74a814b7-71eb-4691-af5d-235e7a75b266> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rebc69e53a0fe4b4c529e0c79_ndacf3541ed5f440aabd46bb442d43858b9 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/74a814b7-71eb-4691-af5d-235e7a75b266> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:rebc69e53a0fe4b4c529e0c79_ndacf3541ed5f440aabd46bb442d43858b10 .
