<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/7bf6e1f8-19e9-46de-804c-dbfa93ea9926> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:re6b5f0c1a251918cc3a71a18_na0ee94ce22484cd1994b677114c6902db2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/7bf6e1f8-19e9-46de-804c-dbfa93ea9926> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:re6b5f0c1a251918cc3a71a18_na0ee94ce22484cd1994b677114c6902db3 .
