<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/7d73cfce-66d1-4dd8-8164-39a43a4c8f88> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:rb7ab9e2e4ae20aadc3adb918_n7b0cc460d33a4db5a296096432217c4db7 .
