<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/83038ede-5668-4479-bcbb-1a230a8f4809> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r41641491cc8eca2674326012_n3f482fdb78b04b71a26596ae8ccd3864b6 .
