<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/852ec4c4-2fec-4350-977a-e6ac1d19afc0> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:rf4f15743274d5756e6754c41_n909588ac4e9d4fda8a3462c7a3a2abcbb9 .
