<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/87c1cfdc-31be-44b0-9976-93cf71e07669> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:r7848ad5e3066a682fbea8c18_nf03377158eb34ad5b61ce39ce1c0f8b2b7 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/87c1cfdc-31be-44b0-9976-93cf71e07669> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/generated_by> _:r7848ad5e3066a682fbea8c18_nf03377158eb34ad5b61ce39ce1c0f8b2b10 .
