<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/87fd1ce4-f9ef-4d81-918f-2779d9fd2e25> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/generated_by> _:r97966b0a8790e096f8d33b96_n7ba38de9d4604e16a2b188a96b6f0200b8 .
