<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/88a50240-c07a-443f-8ae0-fd20a889cc63> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r55f0b52aafbcb05538ebca06_n271447dfd22445359a30a1f641fbfa40b2 .
