<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/8a708d2d-1ac2-4990-9fb2-c22b9d768abf> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rb27967cae5360cf36b45c8c4_n5dbbc0a4980b41d5aa9ec072552c24e9b3 .
