<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/8af48cde-a72b-4f08-880c-53802c0b6c1f> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r74536e89c3e0059283aec850_n224939d136b94118ab6824a2f90408d3b8 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/8af48cde-a72b-4f08-880c-53802c0b6c1f> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r74536e89c3e0059283aec850_n224939d136b94118ab6824a2f90408d3b9 .
