<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/8b78c9a8-9ee3-4c3a-83be-26e0d4ad72ee> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r5d4f67ede34e35d56bfb82a3_n19f3292e1b42489db78a64e0f28c607db4 .
