<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/92918411-678e-40c2-b06c-224fe1b59a30> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r1ad2682de731b6cc42851e7f_n85ff71ede2fa4a03a4496c684fc4d3f6b2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/92918411-678e-40c2-b06c-224fe1b59a30> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r1ad2682de731b6cc42851e7f_n85ff71ede2fa4a03a4496c684fc4d3f6b3 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/92918411-678e-40c2-b06c-224fe1b59a30> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r1ad2682de731b6cc42851e7f_n85ff71ede2fa4a03a4496c684fc4d3f6b4 .
