<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/9c6ed3fb-9a08-4f1a-a0c2-ac24c2cf51d6> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:rfc2648c695e9827569b339a4_ncde5c26e1b934ceab351007236dddf71b2 .
