<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/9dbffa61-2db1-446c-8a1e-be289ac9b60e> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:r6ee04e57f4d4be5d3bdad35c_n9cd9975a2f7e487e9e0668b2a1fa9187b5 .
