<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/a2de1888-b547-4587-938c-ef9e7ecc8c67> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:rafefbdf09cc6b97ec7ea1eb4_n73654e7c725447618c36f86375ebf5eab8 .
