<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/a33213bc-9ec2-4528-bec0-8df0f811d889> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r6b446d5f299898da84250d2c_nbc9880803fd2408eabd515ad0b6242e8b2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/a33213bc-9ec2-4528-bec0-8df0f811d889> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r6b446d5f299898da84250d2c_nbc9880803fd2408eabd515ad0b6242e8b3 .
