<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/a7032230-0a56-438c-a1d2-0761ffd2a20d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
