<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/a7032230-0a56-438c-a1d2-0761ffd2a20d> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rb0894d46ac888f6a8683693f_n6f561480e1c54a1f97e47971eb9f5440b3 .
