<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/abab8e41-710b-4bd9-90b2-812ec46accb1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/abab8e41-710b-4bd9-90b2-812ec46accb1> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:rd4b8e0059e23e1790f51ee6d_neb2849155e0a40f097ad81672bc06d53b2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/abab8e41-710b-4bd9-90b2-812ec46accb1> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rd4b8e0059e23e1790f51ee6d_neb2849155e0a40f097ad81672bc06d53b3 .
