<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/abc7b5bd-a8c3-4f04-92e1-91fa96e99528> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/abc7b5bd-a8c3-4f04-92e1-91fa96e99528> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r6bd7f951366191245da554e1_na86970d78e0e4e82abd300a44cc4730fb2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/abc7b5bd-a8c3-4f04-92e1-91fa96e99528> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r6bd7f951366191245da554e1_na86970d78e0e4e82abd300a44cc4730fb3 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/abc7b5bd-a8c3-4f04-92e1-91fa96e99528> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r6bd7f951366191245da554e1_na86970d78e0e4e82abd300a44cc4730fb4 .
