<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/ac255395-ac21-4606-94ad-ace76ad66819> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:re0273ad006ef685b47a30401_n030fe9ece10641c9b4e58c7039eaade8b3 .
