<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/ade9328f-b5e1-4423-8556-29540208cf3d> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r674bed746d8c47c62314d960_nd5374b755f234af4a87b004e93ff0a93b2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/ade9328f-b5e1-4423-8556-29540208cf3d> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r674bed746d8c47c62314d960_nd5374b755f234af4a87b004e93ff0a93b3 .
