<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/ae843f24-bf6d-444a-a134-dcb92e980f27> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rfde3ae0f1413d4ffdb560464_n712179c170974216b52d48ae5966e028b7 .
