<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/b0216032-748b-48fe-ad4b-e11768f4fa4f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/b0216032-748b-48fe-ad4b-e11768f4fa4f> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r1f7b070ae19a4533eabc3eaf_na44f0e139dd347e588a49d170fba7e87b2 .
