<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/b72632f1-4039-4937-a293-9d9085fb2506> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/b72632f1-4039-4937-a293-9d9085fb2506> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r161d319235075d9a333f1962_n681b61f6ba6d426586a1bc805c21d8f5b2 .
