<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/b912b741-a802-447b-a8ea-a284f1753b67> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Cortical and subcortical gray matter parcellations using output from CAT12.8.1. VBM preprocessing (mwp1) of the IXI dataset (see https://brain-development.org/ixi-dataset/) in all available parcellation resolutions using Schaefer cortical (Schaefer et al., 2018) and Tian (Tian et al., 2020) subcortical atlas. Site information is encoded in the subject-ID and therefore not part of the .csv files. Additionally the file collection contains a reduced version of demographics measurements with subjectIDs magic the brain data (SEX_ID (1=m, 2=f) , HEIGHT, WEIGHT, DOB ,  STUDY_DATE, AGE)." .
