<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/bccb548d-dec0-4ea2-8d10-c93c60ef30f0> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r9403628b3ce4cd4bde63c704_ned03a0d430274f4dad593db2448d2a6eb8 .
