<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/bde8a483-e87d-4425-b517-369322d049e7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/bde8a483-e87d-4425-b517-369322d049e7> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:rdc9c4734ad13f69fc1a3d778_na709506c97e04100b554a8b2b6fd3ab1b2 .
