<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/c17ad57d-d926-434f-b9e0-3babbe3d3e62> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/generated_by> _:r432652e1944b397c41d287f3_n69d68c2e25f1467fa0e906927a26bfe2b9 .
