<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/c235dbc8-89e3-40c7-9915-4777f51d9db6> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r2746bd78cbd386829eeb49cd_n0cd6dc7c3bd7410fa1e035cb9a60cab1b5 .
