<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/c5d4c442-a622-4163-ac23-04cc56b6e41d> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/generated_by> _:rcc84ba5b006dae2c02cd7d6b_nd58c9f957a744838994bde3d32081fa6b7 .
