<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/c96801de-5f95-46be-98d4-98a5a9b8c609> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:r437e5db1ab58540a0c8f3654_n1b1709f8f4c4475084c6a6d1f4faa27cb3 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/c96801de-5f95-46be-98d4-98a5a9b8c609> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r437e5db1ab58540a0c8f3654_n1b1709f8f4c4475084c6a6d1f4faa27cb4 .
