<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/ce91d5a3-22a8-4eb6-b562-4745437161bf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
