<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/cfe671ce-314c-4d86-a306-92e2e593e6dd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/cfe671ce-314c-4d86-a306-92e2e593e6dd> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:r633b80d7d9c406f1b00149ba_n65eef4fe4add43bb86e7137c471366aeb1 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/cfe671ce-314c-4d86-a306-92e2e593e6dd> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:r633b80d7d9c406f1b00149ba_n65eef4fe4add43bb86e7137c471366aeb2 .
