<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/d662411f-cb8a-41aa-b137-f7799359355e> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/d662411f-cb8a-41aa-b137-f7799359355e> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:ra0f8f410f94a4c45e69bd996_nefd48a53229f4f9d9889f017054671a1b2 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/d662411f-cb8a-41aa-b137-f7799359355e> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:ra0f8f410f94a4c45e69bd996_nefd48a53229f4f9d9889f017054671a1b3 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/d662411f-cb8a-41aa-b137-f7799359355e> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:ra0f8f410f94a4c45e69bd996_nefd48a53229f4f9d9889f017054671a1b4 .
