<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/d7d3f6a4-5e1d-4e06-ad1c-589a069d73a2> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r3a3c47b2deaf0c05d80f6763_n3c7e7a49ad074989acc0dd0f91d1b521b3 .
