<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/dcca5e3c-4035-4efd-8a78-3192cb7e2441> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r5f58b66d967a11330e658893_nfc2f22006ba4465ca7e8816ad2ba17bab2 .
