<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/de2674c3-2c81-4a65-988b-1368a15d447a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/de2674c3-2c81-4a65-988b-1368a15d447a> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r00a68a15c1e74099b97056be_n65d6715ab00c472283cfec91f4ba0184b2 .
