<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/de425b79-755e-4dd8-af9c-68b92d3d6db9> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rca326dc44bdaa3dfe7377ab5_n16d4bd324def420192c3aea0cdd8ec5cb8 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/de425b79-755e-4dd8-af9c-68b92d3d6db9> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rca326dc44bdaa3dfe7377ab5_n16d4bd324def420192c3aea0cdd8ec5cb9 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/de425b79-755e-4dd8-af9c-68b92d3d6db9> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:rca326dc44bdaa3dfe7377ab5_n16d4bd324def420192c3aea0cdd8ec5cb10 .
