<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/dffae6a3-c438-4b77-a839-42c9595b9735> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:r37e27926202e5532cb217c74_n2efe1f11e2324b42adc7ba84a6f369e9b8 .
