<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/e3acf3af-3b8b-40ea-87dc-18d29446ced8> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#closeMatch> <https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.1606.02627> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/e3acf3af-3b8b-40ea-87dc-18d29446ced8> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:r74b23a129bbc0591239e1c00_nac8b8ecfebca414d91d6f1b4c96332dbb1 .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/e3acf3af-3b8b-40ea-87dc-18d29446ced8> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotations> _:r74b23a129bbc0591239e1c00_nac8b8ecfebca414d91d6f1b4c96332dbb2 .
