<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/e6b31cf9-30e9-455e-b28d-f08af8617014> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "A talk entitled \"Reproducibility Management in Neuroscience - Specific issues and solutions\", given by Adina S. Wagner at the virtual DGPA/DGPs-Symposium \"Computational Reproducibility\", Nov. 23rd 2020.\n\nThe sources for the slides can be found at github.com/adswa/talk-computational-reproducibility.\n\nA recording of the symposium is available on Youtube: youtube.com/watch?v=nTVcMDVlyOI" .
