<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/e77c63b8-ad36-4020-8389-d8bff15190b0> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r37edd1e2e58b211d70b281fb_n940eecb469344d359bc9fc0a08ee09afb3 .
