<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/ea218c9f-3860-427f-a735-9f045947e64f> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/unreleased/XYZPublication> .
<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/ea218c9f-3860-427f-a735-9f045947e64f> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r860d4636f125b8194f9608f3_nd5c4babb7b0549aa86fbc19e2678deb5b2 .
