<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/ea2c6d21-6c21-4324-b219-fdb30ddf4f91> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:r9c288f37c3a2dede7639c290_nb53bc87e90824570b9fe1be54f8e28dfb8 .
