<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/ec0d9137-465c-486f-b68f-d0fca4532129> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:rcb89fefd33651cce5eb6e66e_n35e8c2e77f5e4168af27776c1c40b518b8 .
