<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/ec30a44d-ab51-4ed5-a531-1b5e18c003ef> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:r88092f8abde69243d32e0aa4_n18628e8355e84f599106ecf9c651d563b2 .
