<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/f0a2fd97-ed18-467e-be62-d97ae7a7f3d1> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/generated_by> _:r05c8803be373dd37dce7da5f_nd2703098b2c54ad3a6288d1832a22b0db10 .
