<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/f5744b2e-85a6-4b99-aaa7-b90124a487c5> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/generated_by> _:r4d67f5e70253b9c83a83a022_na40be5789b9245299d8ac2dba82ab2a4b10 .
