<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/f619e4e9-6f9f-4906-8e1c-b7265cbc72b7> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/characterized_by> _:r10fe8609af80df5d16dde369_n4bede84e111f4bfbba7100776135add2b5 .
