<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/f8d07ac2-b7d4-492f-8dd8-4713bf8cd675> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributed_to> _:r1b784c922955e0caa1e948a1_nd3ee259dad4545a7aaf6baf6af52688bb2 .
