<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/fd7f3b66-e9f2-49ab-8a9f-3e3a9abc891a> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The main website of the TRR379 is the public facing presentation of the consortium. It is specifically built to be the core component of the metadata concept of TRR379. It provides a collection of canonical definitions of entities essential for the function of TRR379." .
