<https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/publications/fec91e0d-f22a-42c8-8170-a0dd87da53f7> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/attributes> _:re6bb955d44d78a3268636602_n6be1d3e7d34f4f5189c460151b77aeafb3 .
