_:r0c0ae745b973a652298cdca5_ne370b0bb0ad64ca8b7e2c2ca3b9963ddb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/88f908e5-40ad-487e-92f5-58d8a1e96aaa> .
