_:r0dd30c0e8fa1fb84971d8a03_n0e24b729bab04b429b68aed2d26f40c3b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/simon-eickhoff> .
