_:r1034711d4574b73cdf937e5d_n30466a2051784788be8c3ca4e8aa2cdfb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/simon-eickhoff> .
