_:r10fe8609af80df5d16dde369_n4bede84e111f4bfbba7100776135add2b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
_:r10fe8609af80df5d16dde369_n4bede84e111f4bfbba7100776135add2b1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.1007/s00414-023-03146-3" .
_:r10fe8609af80df5d16dde369_n4bede84e111f4bfbba7100776135add2b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/simon-eickhoff> .
