_:r22264e9bdc9e3b6421f31401_n871f91c83e8f4715bebf18710b86e43ab4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/11bba584-d08e-47f2-b3d4-980c5472dca3> .
