_:r23a5cad5c2a9a611ec615344_nc17e3dba88074a6db8b84a55e7878a10b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
