_:r2746bd78cbd386829eeb49cd_n0cd6dc7c3bd7410fa1e035cb9a60cab1b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/3cf923ff-969d-4224-bb7b-9f319f0b1564> .
