_:r279ff77643e1e653530a23bb_nad2abc848a2d45cf95d95437a789bd96b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
_:r279ff77643e1e653530a23bb_nad2abc848a2d45cf95d95437a789bd96b1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.1016/j.neuroimage.2022.119648" .
