_:r2bceda4d79f4580cd17f4e7a_na26f5875c5654240b6a1f6a8c4f344cab4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
