_:r33172c569eb5cebfc62e52c6_ne4af4e81b98a46728490b861503723c0b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
