_:r3392f5309e68674fa1a9a102_nd4e8afc6446a4920b932d8f71ad6a861b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
