_:r355157e9d4e7937de61c75f3_n08be78fe62ff43c39ffaa7e2a53b49b7b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
