_:r355157e9d4e7937de61c75f3_n08be78fe62ff43c39ffaa7e2a53b49b7b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/simon-eickhoff> .
_:r355157e9d4e7937de61c75f3_n08be78fe62ff43c39ffaa7e2a53b49b7b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
