_:r35f4d7d532fd42aa9355a327_n15504a7ee9e94e389df8cc82454c7c43b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
