_:r37e6991f2ddc8deb2d3f5d04_n8a4749db851144b881fb0a3942374ba8b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/ae7f5e91-61dc-47cb-945c-9d248dfe58f0> .
