_:r37edd1e2e58b211d70b281fb_n940eecb469344d359bc9fc0a08ee09afb1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
