_:r3a0eaf9dd66578609ddd1e8c_nc511428fa2714d22bb8b610d3834e398b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/719c0f2c-1d1b-4d2f-8320-101230f855fa> .
_:r3a0eaf9dd66578609ddd1e8c_nc511428fa2714d22bb8b610d3834e398b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
