_:r3c38a78847ea197ac8afef65_nc95e99792105464b8747f899c0691b11b3 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Michael Hanke is a group leader at Forschungszentrum Jülich and an internationally renowned expert on psychoinformatics.nHe takes on the high responsibility of data management and research software and secures the use, reproducibility andnaccessibility of large data sets that TRR379 strives for." .
