_:r3e06c7fd1101cecaf8d59a92_ndcff2ebdc7b94a449f65ca96ae340491b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
