_:r3e835326dde60f67c9f23ca5_ne75b2e3516fc47ea990d5c27b00b25eeb5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/8f836375-520c-43d7-afb6-29abea72c0ab> .
