_:r43fe795d18410724c1196550_n83fff80314714c0699ba0b9098457ce3b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/269a3b65-df26-4c0d-a6a9-2c4410750dc8> .
