_:r44724e7f2d8933eda92616cd_n29c1bcc2a7dd4f83a3ac15763358472eb3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/simon-eickhoff> .
