_:r49484a99ebf0042d57f87b18_nbc148006f63440f0b0b3962aedd07c6ab1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
