_:r4b1a9e0975d4c27e56db272f_n06f3dc3aff314fdd8d58c628280224a0b1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.1111/bjop.12595" .
_:r4b1a9e0975d4c27e56db272f_n06f3dc3aff314fdd8d58c628280224a0b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/9fe30b8c-a331-4166-bd1c-f407b6e06ecc> .
_:r4b1a9e0975d4c27e56db272f_n06f3dc3aff314fdd8d58c628280224a0b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
