_:r4cc04aeb7d95761d9963cbf7_n2b098d49aa7646a88775666de056bff3b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
_:r4cc04aeb7d95761d9963cbf7_n2b098d49aa7646a88775666de056bff3b1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.1093/braincomms/fcad200" .
_:r4cc04aeb7d95761d9963cbf7_n2b098d49aa7646a88775666de056bff3b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/ced8fa1d-c7c6-4f66-b569-a9d277347227> .
_:r4cc04aeb7d95761d9963cbf7_n2b098d49aa7646a88775666de056bff3b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
