_:r4fb2580cd483f58c48d6a1b1_nbde9824bee6d4fc1b7b1a14d47ef23e8b7 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/AcademicArticle> .
