_:r518d5d9506ab4f4a1737bd37_nc6de79ad23b3488fa8b9e730805fb2bfb1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
