_:r527217d69d3907028774fa82_n80b8aa2183d34a75af6f15ba7378ad92b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
_:r527217d69d3907028774fa82_n80b8aa2183d34a75af6f15ba7378ad92b1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.1038/s42003-022-03196-0" .
