_:r5552fe582e840b635fad9380_n2b2e639a1bbc49a0958367dc699384a1b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Eine Bedrohung für den Sinn? Human Enhancement und das sinnvolle LebenA threat for meaningfulness? Human enhancement and the meaningful life" .
_:r5552fe582e840b635fad9380_n2b2e639a1bbc49a0958367dc699384a1b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> .
_:r5552fe582e840b635fad9380_n2b2e639a1bbc49a0958367dc699384a1b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r5552fe582e840b635fad9380_n2b2e639a1bbc49a0958367dc699384a1b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "The general theme of this article is the connection between two topics which are well-researched on their own, but are hardly linked to each other: the debate on human enhancement and the meaning in life debate. More precisely, the article explores the claim whether there is reason to believe that enhancement techniques can undermine the meaning of one’s life." .
