_:r5763a4b54ef0f5331ec1a022_n9cc586d317e34d7298210c69d51a0887b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/f012978a-c0be-46ae-ba97-1e6f2abd5c7f> .
