_:r5d4f67ede34e35d56bfb82a3_n19f3292e1b42489db78a64e0f28c607db1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
