_:r6c6a33d5dff4d89b485a9cec_n41ec51f2ea4b455d97bf256d652eb5a8b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Annotation> .
