_:r6cdb2bb274a8cd2ff438649b_nebb9d6a4b19c4c9d8bbf52cd12425839b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/263a71a9-94aa-43d0-9686-6980290fafaf> .
