_:r6e91e62ea138c316e857a037_nedff169c7aea46908ed66c8bde73e206b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
_:r6e91e62ea138c316e857a037_nedff169c7aea46908ed66c8bde73e206b1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.1007/s12028-023-01816-z" .
