_:r74f260296a4dcddf5571604c_n8f7e840e9aa84af3836477829c71f4d7b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/02217afa-9a22-4c51-a3cf-d23c6ca568bf> .
_:r74f260296a4dcddf5571604c_n8f7e840e9aa84af3836477829c71f4d7b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
