_:r75e61f1aa1567386e1038eb7_n227cbebd9d594628889a2c377c284cfab1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
_:r75e61f1aa1567386e1038eb7_n227cbebd9d594628889a2c377c284cfab1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.1016/j.intell.2021.101545" .
