_:r762e017153805f7078d91f5b_n86afc584f3844079822c74cd58e419a8b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
