_:r77a0d79461ec25a5e7099ecd_n66bcfa05c74c4d75823c442afa1f3e2fb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/simon-eickhoff> .
