_:r7900bcc6f4490aaf4342ceb1_n5f6323b2c6a74e66afbf8b04de94055db1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.1186/s13229-026-00707-2" .
_:r7900bcc6f4490aaf4342ceb1_n5f6323b2c6a74e66afbf8b04de94055db2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/6ae68288-73ec-491b-a25f-75bbf9783e70> .
_:r7900bcc6f4490aaf4342ceb1_n5f6323b2c6a74e66afbf8b04de94055db2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
