_:r7ad9acca3b0ba351e0300978_ndd51f4b1fc9940adae1e0eddef1dec39b1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.1002/hbm.24746" .
_:r7ad9acca3b0ba351e0300978_ndd51f4b1fc9940adae1e0eddef1dec39b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/simon-eickhoff> .
