_:r7e8ce5826bf85cb52b934c03_n01b5a1cc78844f82b5bd821196cf1226b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/719c0f2c-1d1b-4d2f-8320-101230f855fa> .
