_:r800e04f518c146832a6056ea_nbb4b38f9a7714e0089c144d90f083deab1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
_:r800e04f518c146832a6056ea_nbb4b38f9a7714e0089c144d90f083deab1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.1162/netn_a_00406" .
_:r800e04f518c146832a6056ea_nbb4b38f9a7714e0089c144d90f083deab2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/c6d47fbc-8b3c-46d1-9558-1f3b94ec9141> .
_:r800e04f518c146832a6056ea_nbb4b38f9a7714e0089c144d90f083deab2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
