_:r8669e7d0ebad0e2b84a0c792_n3c05cde22f1c4d1d9cc5373bcefbc027b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/d2d8d235-90de-4919-b0b9-f0de82d7b07f> .
