_:r880a20819f0da8866914c72e_nb0c983b4eeb746c98fb3d53b13159e8eb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/94433ef8-8ae1-4922-9638-755444076dc3> .
