_:r88f1122c0567053f63d40b2f_n5a3df7a3e0a24f1b875f0a164a2b256bb9 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Statement> .
