_:r8c1d7a6e455a7e48c6076bc0_n47046217ba7c458283cde2c68411cfe7b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/6ae68288-73ec-491b-a25f-75bbf9783e70> .
