_:r8e805ba586173eb6706f466e_nf5ee096ef4234cbd8f4f7c653506a0dab2 <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/annotation_value> "m.hanke@fz-juelich.de" .
_:r8e805ba586173eb6706f466e_nf5ee096ef4234cbd8f4f7c653506a0dab3 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Provides neuroinformatics and FAIR‑data leadership and enables the project’s reproducible data management: he guides standardized metadata and SOP integration, ensures use of community standards (BIDS, DICOM, VCF, CDE/CRF, EEG formats), and implements DataLad as the versioned dataset index and provenance tracker to record dataset snapshots, file‑level availability, and analysis provenance—supporting distributed storage, controlled access, and machine‑readable catalogue generation so multi‑site datasets are findable, accessible (via DUAs/licenses where needed), interoperable and reusable over the project’s lifetime." .
