_:r8f8604ec757e30732e54e87c_n743dfb54abfe4ef8aee2c5bf722bedb4b1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.1080/1357650X.2021.1932983" .
_:r8f8604ec757e30732e54e87c_n743dfb54abfe4ef8aee2c5bf722bedb4b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> .
_:r8f8604ec757e30732e54e87c_n743dfb54abfe4ef8aee2c5bf722bedb4b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r8f8604ec757e30732e54e87c_n743dfb54abfe4ef8aee2c5bf722bedb4b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Laterality 2020: Response to the article commentaries" .
_:r8f8604ec757e30732e54e87c_n743dfb54abfe4ef8aee2c5bf722bedb4b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#predicate> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> .
_:r8f8604ec757e30732e54e87c_n743dfb54abfe4ef8aee2c5bf722bedb4b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
_:r8f8604ec757e30732e54e87c_n743dfb54abfe4ef8aee2c5bf722bedb4b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "In our recent opinion paper “Laterality 2020: entering the next decade”, we highlighted trends that we thought are likely to shape laterality research in the 2020s. Our opinion paper inspired 11 commentaries by experts from several disciplines which discussed a wide range of topics complementing the 10 trends we identified in the opinion paper. In this reply, we summarize and discuss the 11 commentaries by clustering them into 3 different main topics. The topic that was covered by the largest number of commentaries was the role of comparative and evolutionary approaches in laterality research. Moreover, several comments focused on the ontogenesis of hemispheric asymmetries and the importance of reliability and validity in laterality research. Embracing the technical advances, research trends and controversies laid out in the commentaries will significantly improve our understanding of several of the core questions of laterality research." .
_:r8f8604ec757e30732e54e87c_n743dfb54abfe4ef8aee2c5bf722bedb4b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <http://purl.org/ontology/bibo/AcademicArticle> .
