_:ra5d9702e6606c76d7e702f4a_n8e7f20b5b73542528ad4bd5264c47938b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/15a9b2f2-d2a0-47f1-aaa6-ca8d4ed541b0> .
_:ra5d9702e6606c76d7e702f4a_n8e7f20b5b73542528ad4bd5264c47938b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
