_:rbc1d31666fc89dad6c745c86_n26af7ae167ca4ec585d40401da7c712eb5 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Processing of visual and non-visual naturalistic spatial information in the 'parahippocampal place area'" .
