_:rc5bc3a5bb2cd0d7d97c191e5_nc7df5a4df77f46958fe2e86957aa8445b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/c5630bae-5817-4599-a579-aa4fcadec6e9> .
_:rc5bc3a5bb2cd0d7d97c191e5_nc7df5a4df77f46958fe2e86957aa8445b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
