_:rc7bc7551cbf2b2ba94f6e20b_na2a82d3d6ca24c05bc54fcb0210b31c1b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
