_:rc9084753851e6f8332092fc8_n2e4c74fcb41541c2988b9c42b6fcfc27b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/ae7f5e91-61dc-47cb-945c-9d248dfe58f0> .
