_:rcc514037870d2f438355d2a7_nab06757008544640beebda1cc2938b73b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
_:rcc514037870d2f438355d2a7_nab06757008544640beebda1cc2938b73b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/9fe30b8c-a331-4166-bd1c-f407b6e06ecc> .
_:rcc514037870d2f438355d2a7_nab06757008544640beebda1cc2938b73b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
