_:rcc84ba5b006dae2c02cd7d6b_nd58c9f957a744838994bde3d32081fa6b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
