_:rcf3cf4434cdd476727e374c2_ndbfb7f2e9f294e9998dcc5bba9177a8eb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/6ae68288-73ec-491b-a25f-75bbf9783e70> .
