_:rcfadb9681c8bb8f6f92eca8d_n59d544e0a4b24bf88160738fca456e95b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/535129e4-fc67-4e19-8f5e-0d4a43a4578c> .
