_:rcfadb9681c8bb8f6f92eca8d_n59d544e0a4b24bf88160738fca456e95b4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/6f88279f-da52-4203-839f-5496ffef2894> .
