_:rd08608b83b3e717d07b11777_nfcbf2e7316a84d6bba0ec029f46b3acbb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
_:rd08608b83b3e717d07b11777_nfcbf2e7316a84d6bba0ec029f46b3acbb3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/simon-eickhoff> .
