_:rd3551054ccd4f8a5c2429323_n9dcbd19f3a5a4d31b344004906c9e1d2b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
