_:rd4b8e0059e23e1790f51ee6d_neb2849155e0a40f097ad81672bc06d53b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
