_:rd8c38a7b0477fdef9118f2a6_nc59694aebada46749983f21dc00b8e83b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
