_:rdd7b522a0a35402ddde921e5_n6d3ac224960840188c666d162b44d599b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Probabilistic cytoarchitectonic map of Area 6d3 (SFS) (v4.0)" .
