_:rde83a0d659aed188048eed76_n216d1d70d5734a4b959536777b118957b1 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/DOI> .
_:rde83a0d659aed188048eed76_n216d1d70d5734a4b959536777b118957b1 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#notation> "10.6084/M9.FIGSHARE.12958181" .
