_:re59e1debb548f71f2a073f41_nf0d25f80336248b4a9c33adaa7726bfeb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/3cf923ff-969d-4224-bb7b-9f319f0b1564> .
