_:re66cf57d5e4b4199f4ae4df8_n868a6a6a96a34ed0be87803986b6e4e4b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "<p>This component contains the data of the analysis that we ran as a validation of the annotation of speech spoken in the research cut (Hanke et al., 2016) of the movie \"Forrest Gump\" (Zemeckis, 1994) and its audio-description. The corresponding paper is hosted on github (https://github.com/psychoinformatics-de/studyforrest-paper-speechannotation)&nbsp;and published in f1000research (https://doi.org/10.12688/f1000research.27621.1).</p>" .
