_:rebc69e53a0fe4b4c529e0c79_ndacf3541ed5f440aabd46bb442d43858b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/4bbd6721-42e7-4a31-93cc-8ff0e9814e93> .
_:rebc69e53a0fe4b4c529e0c79_ndacf3541ed5f440aabd46bb442d43858b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
