_:rf2e7189c9aa8565b9d446fb2_n39171c6c344f46e487e9d7688594de20b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/simon-eickhoff> .
_:rf2e7189c9aa8565b9d446fb2_n39171c6c344f46e487e9d7688594de20b2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
_:rf2e7189c9aa8565b9d446fb2_n39171c6c344f46e487e9d7688594de20b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/ae7f5e91-61dc-47cb-945c-9d248dfe58f0> .
