_:rf56d9689c7a77888ebc5ac4a_n5e39ea6969504f708031d49157904439b6 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/AttributeSpecification> .
