_:rfab1267383a6534f3ae4a400_n3caba56fec1e487e98318dc0fea4525fb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#object> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/demo-research-information/ns/persons/ced8fa1d-c7c6-4f66-b569-a9d277347227> .
_:rfab1267383a6534f3ae4a400_n3caba56fec1e487e98318dc0fea4525fb2 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://concepts.datalad.org/s/things/v2/Attribution> .
